{%- comment -%}
  ADAPTER: Order tracking swap point.

  Current state (native, no app): sections/track-order-page.liquid
  points customers to their account order history and the tracking
  link already in Shopify's shipping-confirmation email - there is no
  public storefront endpoint for guest order lookup by number without
  an app or custom backend.

  To add a real "enter order number + email" guest tracking form:
    1. Pick a tracking app, or build a small backend (app proxy) that
       validates the order number/email pair against the Admin API and
       returns shipment status.
    2. Add the form to sections/track-order-page.liquid, submitting to
       that endpoint instead of (or alongside) the current cards.
    3. Keep the existing account-history and email-link cards - they
       work today and cost nothing to keep as a fallback if the new
       endpoint is ever unreachable.
{%- endcomment -%}
